flowchart LR
  P[Untrusted model proposal] --> S[Wire and budget checks]
  S --> A[Host operation grants]
  A --> B[Catalog and meaning binding]
  B --> O{Outcome}
  O -->|bound| V[Semantic and capability checks]
  O -->|needs-choice| CH[User choice]
  O -->|needs-meaning| M[AI-assisted or manual definition]
  O -->|invalid / denied / unsupported / stale| D[Diagnostic, no effect]
  V --> E[Evaluate]
  E --> PP[Propose relevant presentation]
  PP --> C[Validate and recheck before commit]
  C --> UI[Validated UI within declared contracts]
  UI --> N[Interpretation can still be wrong: scope and evidence visible]
